From 4728a9362d0ac1ba9f2fa1f824a278e6b782fa94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sir-MmD <27060102+Sir-MmD@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:58:40 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] FireSafari: name, package, link scheme and icon

Release builds are app.firesafari with the firesafari:// link scheme and no Firefox
sharedUserId, so they install next to Firefox. Launcher icon, home-page logo,
wordmark and search widget preview show the FireSafari flame.
